why Every Alliance quest of the Excavation Site in one run, lead-ins included.

# The Excavation Site's Alliance quests in one guide: Dorin Songblade in
# Redridge, the pick-ups and lead-ins in Menethil Harbor and the Wetlands,
# one run through the dungeon, then the hand-ins. Steps already done are
# passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain stands.
#
# The chains:
# - Dorin Songblade's 95772 Songblade Search, to his brother Daewyn inside,
#   who gives 95795 Fallen in the Fen back to Dorin.
# - James Halloran's 484 Young Crocolisk Skins -> 98815 Highland Hides (Thicket
#   Raptor Hides).
# - First Mate Fitzsimmons' 463 The Greenwarden -> Rethiel's 276 Tramping Paws
#   -> 277 Fire Taboo -> 275 Blisters on the Land -> 95646 Horrors in the
#   Highland (the Highland Horror's Rootcore).
# - Caitlin Grassman's 95647 Lost in the Thicket Things, to Ardin Grassman
#   inside, who gives 95809 Heartwoven back to Caitlin.
# - The Relic Guardian's Titan Relic (item 270865) starts 95810 Lost Relic
#   Carry, for Prospector Whelgar, who gives 98824 Prehistoric Prism, for High
#   Explorer Magellas in Ironforge.
#
# Left out: 95737 Seeking Caitlin, Llana's breadcrumb in Astranaar,
# Ashenvale: Caitlin gives her quest without it, and the trip to Kalimdor and
# back is far off this route.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places anything inside, so the goals stand at
# the door (@50.8,61.1) with `group 5`. The bosses come in the order of a run
# of my own (as a Horde character: Saltspine, Shadetooth, then the Relic
# Guardian) with the Highland Horror where the client's journal puts him,
# third; that run did not meet him. Every quest goal is counted by the quest
# log, so a group that takes them in another order still gets each step
# ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items and rewards: Polestar's reference data (data/forever,
#   built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's Codex page for
#   the dungeon.
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - A run of my own on 2026-11-12 (Horde, five players), which the Horde
#   guide's header describes: the bosses' order and the raptors around
#   Shadetooth.
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   26 to 33).
# INGAME: where inside do Ardin Grassman, Daewyn Songblade and the Highland
#   Horror stand?

